hat the durable record cannot resolve safely.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:11:You may recommend acceptance, request a ruling, or block the story, but you do not accept the story on behalf of impl-lead.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:296:  rulings:\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:312:Seeded first-turn instruction (not a prior runtime self-note): include `selfNote` when you want to leave a durable reminder for a later planner turn, for example `Track whether the next verifier pass still needs the ruling evidence.`\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:344:Allowed actions: run-implement, run-continue, run-self-review, run-verify, run-quick-fix, accept-story, request-ruling, block-story, fail-story\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:364:Caller implication: Read the public status and final package to decide impl-lead follow-up such as accept, reopen, or ruling.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:371:Outcome: needs-ruling\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:373:Caller implication: Surface the ruling request instead of guessing or downgrading the decision into cleanup debt.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:410:{\"action\":\"request-ruling\",\"rationale\":\"...\",\"inputs\":{\"decisionType\":\"...\",\"