ompact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:206:| TC-4.4 | 4.6, 4.7 | view-boundary | no backward motion across small batches; compact resets to compact point; fresh tail full | |\\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:208:| TC-4.6 | 4.9 | view-boundary | injected advance failure: intake succeeds, boundary unmoved, status shows over-max; next batch heals | injection seam; also asserts poke still fired (drain ran) |\\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:209:| TC-5.1 | 5.1 | view-render-targets | array opens with bands in gradient order then tail in record order; deterministic | |\\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:210:| TC-5.2 | 5.2, 5.3 | view-render-targets | materialize/pull parity item-for-item; repeat byte-identical; thread state hash unchanged | |\\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:211:| TC-5.3 | 5.4 | view-render-targets | never-compacted materialize: valid tail-only file loadable against fixture | |\\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:213:| TC-5.5 | 5.3 | view-render-targets | materialized file validates against real-PI-session structure fixture | header line, entry shape, parentId chain |\\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:223:| zero-provider sweep across all five ops | view-sweep | The provider fake is in scope for fixtures; nothing stops an internal \\\"helpful\\\" derivation call except this assert. The epic's no-inference rule needs teeth. |\\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread